nd, er, another one for tuesday as well, again for the Physio contacts please\"], [\"Could you tell me whether I have any notes about contacts?\", \"Would you mind creating a note called Books to read this summer?\", \"Could you please add a task for friday to deal with Physio contacts?\", \"Would you also add a task for tuesday to deal with Physio contacts, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-061\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind moving the test appointment to next friday, please?\", \"Could you show me the to-dos I've completed?\", \"Could I see just the ones from this week, please?\"], [\"pls move the test appt to next friday\", \"show me my done todos\", \"just this week\"], [\"Can you move my test appointment to next friday?\", \"What tasks have I finished?\", \"Which of those were done this week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-062\", \"v\": [[\"Cabin stuff?\"], [\"What have I got in the vault about Cabin?\"], [\"Could you tell me what's in my vault relating to Cabin, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-063\", \"v\": [[\"delete the draft note pls\", \"what did i write in my journal yesterday\", \"show me someday tasks with no deadline\"], [\"Would you mind deleting the draft note, please?\", \"Could you tell me what I wrote in my journal yesterday?\", \"Could you please list my someday tasks that have no deadline?\"], [\"Can you get rid of the draft note?\", \"What did I put in my diary entry yesterday?\", \"Which to-dos are someday ones without a due date?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-064\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what time the test is, please?\"], [\"What time is my test?\"], [\"wat time is the test\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-065\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind finding my notes on ideas, please?\"], [\"oh, um, could you dig out those notes I jotted down on ideas?\"], [\"ideas notes\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-066\", \"v\": [[\"when do i have Choir\", \"whats else on that day\"], [\"Choir when?\", \"rest of that day?\"], [\"Could you tell me when I have Choir?\", \"Would you mind telling me what else is on